## 🌟 Introduction

Founded in 1980 by Carlo Crocco, **Hublot** disrupted traditional Swiss watchmaking by pioneering a daring combination: pairing a precious 18k gold case with a sporty natural rubber strap. This revolutionary concept birthed Hublot's core design philosophy—**"The Art of Fusion."**

Under the visionary leadership of Jean-Claude Biver in 2004, Hublot elevated this philosophy to new heights with the launch of the iconic **Big Bang chronograph**. Today, Hublot stands as a vanguard of modern luxury horology, famous for combining unconventional materials, avant-garde aesthetics, and high-performance mechanical movements.

In this guide, we will explore Hublot's signature collections, proprietary material innovations, and groundbreaking movement engineering.

