## ⚙️ In-House Movement Engineering: The UNICO Engine

At the heart of modern Hublot chronographs beats the **HUB1280 UNICO Manufacture Movement**. Engineered entirely in-house, the UNICO caliber stands out through several distinct technical features:

```text
[ Mainspring Barrel ] ──> [ Gear Train ] ──> [ Escapement Wheel (Silicon) ]
                                                     │
[ Dial Side ] <─── [ Double Clutch ] <─── [ Column Wheel (At 6 O'Clock) ]
```

* **Dial-Side Column Wheel:** Unlike traditional chronographs where the column wheel sits on the movement back, Hublot positioned it at **6 o'clock on the dial side**, allowing wearers to observe the mechanical engagement when pressing the pusher.
* **Modular Escapement Architecture:** Features a removable escapement platform with a lightweight silicon lever and escape wheel, reducing friction and extending power reserve to **72 hours**.
* **Flyback Function:** Allows instant resetting and restarting of the chronograph timer with a single push of the lower pusher.

