## ❓ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)

#### Q1: Why are Hublot watches so popular among athletes and celebrities?
Hublot pioneered major high-profile sports partnerships, becoming the official timekeeper for FIFA World Cup™, UEFA Champions League, and top luxury lifestyle ambassadors. Their bold, instantly recognizable design fits modern celebrity aesthetics.

#### Q2: What is the "One Click" system on Hublot watches?
It is Hublot's patented quick-release mechanism allowing wearers to swap watch straps instantly without any tools by pressing a trapezoidal button located on the top and bottom lugs.

#### Q3: Are Hublot watches considered "Haute Horlogerie"?
Yes. While entry-level Classic Fusion models use modified ETA/Sellita bases, Hublot's Manufacture models feature high-complication in-house calibers including bi-axial tourbillons, minute repeaters, and multi-barrel long power reserve engines (like the MP-11).

